    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβλαστ-άνω</span></b> , aor. I <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεβλάστησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Alim.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			, but inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβλαστεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.23.1
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>shoot, sprout,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.2.3
			</span></i> : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύραννος ἐκ προστατικῆς ῥίζης ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					565d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>grow out of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἰδίην ἰδέην</span> Hp.l.c.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cause to grow, produce,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξοδον χλοῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jb.</u>
					38.27
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>cause to revive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φυήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
